 "note": "Curvy, 10 platforms, 3 relays. The centre (a T4) sits in a roundabout: a ring road of curves and junctions that passes through each side's gate platform and meets the centre by the stems of an X at the top and a T at the bottom. The upper ring is a Curve_90 each side, the lower ring two Curve_45s; the gates (retract) hold the lower ring's first decks, and the top platform (over Curve_45 arches, and on the X) is a remote console for the lower ring's last decks. Bridges: S / M / L, Curve_90, Curve_45, X, T.",
